==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Dogenstein]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Rel]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Queen B]] spawns as the boss after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*4 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 93.33~100 seconds<sup>2,800f~3,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Techn-Old Hyena]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 93.33~100 seconds<sup>2,800f~3,000f</sup>.
*5 [[J.J. Jackrabbit]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 66.67~73.33 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Capy]] spawns after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Save money and time a [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to nuke the Techn-Old Hyena, killing it or removing a huge chunk of his health. [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] is an amazing choice for cleaning up the crazy hyena, for it can sneak in high-damaging hits while having Warp Blocker. Once the hyena dies, just spam meatshields and [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cats]] to keep the Capy at bay, along with [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman]] and [[Cossack Cat (Rare Cat)|Royal Guard Cat]] to kill Queen B.
To stall the enemies, use [[Manic Mohawk Cat]], [[Manic Eraser Cat]] and [[Boulder Cat]]. As expected, Research Up combos help increase Boulder's effectiveness, so bringing them is recommended.

